      {
       "kind": "caption",
       "text": "Liar’s Bar rules, reworked: six chambers become six crocodile teeth, and one bite replaces the bullet.",
       "cx": 959.0,
       "y": 1988
      },
      {
       "kind": "caption",
       "text": "Card and table art borrows from the circus — bold stripes, big-top red.",
       "cx": 958.0,
       "y": 13632
      },
      {
       "kind": "caption",
       "text": "Crocodile three-view",
       "cx": 1440.0,
       "y": 14598
      },
      {
       "kind": "para",
       "x": 202,
       "y": 8064,
       "w": 700,
       "text": "Onboarding walks a new player through one complete round:\nread the claimed hand and decide whether to trust it or call\nthe bluff. Reveal the cards, then press a crocodile tooth\nwhen the challenge is lost. Five teeth are safe; one bites.\nEach prompt appears only when it is needed, rehearsing the\nfull loop once before the player’s first ranked match."
      },
      {
       "kind": "para",
       "x": 202.0,
       "y": 9868.0,
       "w": 1516.0,
       "text": "The visual system fuses cyberpunk nightlife with the punch of American comic panels, the theatrical tension of a travelling circus and the restraint of premium minimalist vector design. Hard silhouettes, halftone grain, oversized type and saturated red–violet contrasts give every screen a sense of spectacle. A controlled palette, simple geometry and generous negative space keep each bluffing state clear, legible and consistent at mobile scale."
      },
      {
       "kind": "para",
       "x": 202,
       "y": 12742,
       "w": 1516,
       "text": "Four colours carry the whole cast. Hair, accessories and outfits are all drawn from one palette, so each character reads at a glance across the table and stays legible at the small sizes the lobby uses. The same four hues run through cards, chips and the crocodile itself."
      },
      {
       "kind": "charcap",
       "text": "An 80s Hollywood diva — elegant, composed, commanding.",
       "cx": 522,
       "y": 10795
      },
      {
       "kind": "charcap",
       "text": "A cold, alluring Asian agent — skilled and observant.",
       "cx": 522,
       "y": 11183
      },
      {
       "kind": "charcap",
       "text": "Cool and aloof outside, blushes the moment she is startled.",
       "cx": 522,
       "y": 11571
      },
      {
       "kind": "charcap",
       "text": "A playful American girl — carefree, then decisive.",
       "cx": 522,
       "y": 11959
      },
      {
       "kind": "charcap",
       "text": "A high-school jock — confident, comically dramatic when scared.",
       "cx": 1395,
       "y": 10797
      },
      {
       "kind": "charcap",
       "text": "A mature Latin man — calm, deep and restrained.",
       "cx": 1395,
       "y": 11183
      },
      {
       "kind": "charcap",
       "text": "The club owner — impeccably dressed, menacing under pressure.",
